      <p data-mce-fragment="1"><b data-mce-fragment="1">Design: </b><span data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-weight: 400;" data-mce-style="font-weight: 400;">Our ‘Heart of Gold’ pendant necklace is a Modern Classic that features a minimal Gold Heart pendant laid on a sturdy chain.</span></p>
<p data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-weight: 400;" data-mce-style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Salve Style Tip:</strong> Pair this pendant necklace with a white shirt for work/your favourite LBD for parties, and complete the look with a bracelet.</span></p>
<p data-mce-fragment="1"><span data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-weight: 400;" data-mce-style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Ready-to-Gift Box:</strong> Presenting the Salve ‘Heart of Gold’ pendant in a Ready-to-Gift box. Perfect gift for your Sister this Raksha Bandhan.</span></p>
<p data-mce-fragment="1"><b data-mce-fragment="1">ANTI-TARNISH:</b><span data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-weight: 400;" data-mce-style="font-weight: 400;"> This pendant comes with an anti-tarnish plating that acts as a shield and will keep your favourite jewellery protected from rusting or oxidation.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p data-mce-fragment="1"><b data-mce-fragment="1">STAINLESS STEEL:&nbsp;</b><span data-mce-fragment="1" style="font-weight: 400;" data-mce-style="font-weight: 400;">No rusting, no tarnish, no worries. Made of stainless steel: skin-friendly, hypoallergenic, luxurious classic necklace design.&nbsp;</span></p>
    </div>

